sequence-diagram

typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel
autoNumber on

Customer [icon: user, label: "Customer"] > CommerceAPI [label: "Commerce API"]: Submit checkout with idempotency key
CommerceAPI > Checkout [label: "Checkout and Orders"]: Validate request
Checkout > Database [icon: aws-rds, label: "PostgreSQL"]: Find existing idempotency result
Database --> Checkout: No existing result
Checkout > Inventory [label: "Inventory Service"]: Reserve requested quantities
Inventory > Database: Atomically reserve available stock
Database --> Inventory: Reservation committed
Inventory --> Checkout: Return reservation identifier
Checkout > Database: Create order in pending payment state
Database --> Checkout: Return order identifier
Checkout > Payment [label: "Payment Provider"]: Create payment using stable merchant reference
Payment --> Checkout: Payment authorized
Checkout > Database: Commit paid state and transactional outbox event
Database --> Checkout: Commit complete
Checkout --> CommerceAPI: Order confirmed
CommerceAPI --> Customer: Return confirmed order
Checkout > OutboxRelay [label: "Outbox Relay"]: Read committed event
OutboxRelay > EventBus [icon: aws-eventbridge, label: "EventBridge"]: Publish OrderPaid event
EventBus > Workers [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "SQS Consumers"]: Route asynchronous work
Workers --> Checkout: Fulfilment, notification and analytics continue asynchronously
